<title>INDIA: CRICKET - SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY FIVE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY FIVE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>RAJKOT, India 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat India by five wickets with eight balls to spare in the Titan Cup limited-overs triangular cricket series on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 185 all out in 48.1 overs, South Africa 188 for five in 48.4 overs.</p>
